# Changelog

All notable changes made to the Jo's Bakery website project are documented in this file.

The project follows the Keep a Changelog format.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-11-02

### Added
- Created the home page (`index.html`).
- Created the About Us page (`about.html`).
- Created the Products and Services page (`services.html`).
- Created the Enquiries page (`enquiries.html`).
- Created the Contact Us page (`contact.html`).
- Added a shared stylesheet (`style.css`) for consistent website design.
- Added JavaScript functionality (`script.js`) for product searching and enquiry form validation.
- Added a sitemap (`sitemap.xml`) to help search engines discover website pages.
- Added a `robots.txt` file with crawler instructions.
- Added a `README.md` file containing the project overview, objectives, technologies and setup instructions.
- Added a `REFERENCES.md` file documenting technical reference sources.
- Added navigation links between website pages.
- Added contact information and opening hours.
- Added responsive styling for desktop, tablet and mobile screens.
- Added form labels, validation messages and basic accessibility features.

### Changed
- Standardised the website's colours, typography, buttons and layout.
- Improved navigation consistency across the website pages.
- Updated the product page to include a product-search feature.
- Improved the layout of the enquiry and contact forms.

### Fixed
- Added client-side validation for required enquiry form fields.
- Improved feedback when visitors enter invalid information.
- Improved the website layout on smaller screens.

### Notes
- The enquiry form currently validates information in the browser but does not send enquiries to an email inbox.
- Contact details, opening hours, map coordinates and website URLs must be checked before final publication.
- The changes listed above describe the intended project files. Confirm that each feature has been implemented and tested before submitting the final version.